comment: number guessing game
grab and use "io" from the standard library.

establish "max tries" become 3.
let "secret" become random number from 1 to 10.
let "tries" become 0.

this loop while the value of "tries" is less than the value of "max tries"
    read "guess" from I/O.
    change "tries" to the value of "tries" plus 1.
    this if the value of "guess" is the value of "secret"
        say "Correct!".
        stop.
    otherwise
        say "Wrong!".
    end this
end this

say "Game over.".
end executable.

comment: another game

this function speak.
    this if i = 0.
    this else say "no".
end this